{"type":"brain_event","event_id":"evt-36f3f860c0dc","ts":"2026-11-06T12:37:43.028765Z","layer":"brain","domain":"energy","kind":"scenario_marker","correlation_id":null,"summary":"START E13 Multi-zone coordination: re-dispatch, make before break (fast mode, Twin over REST)","payload":{"scenario":"E13","description":"Meshed city C. D surges first and is relieved into B (the best single move then). A then surges; its only tie also goes to B, which no longer has room, so every single move is infeasible. The planner finds a 3-step plan: relieve D into C instead (close T-DC), then free B (open T-DB), then close T-AB. Each step is gated and verified; no zone is overloaded in between and nobody is cut off."}}
